    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense for the admin stuff. but if i'm being real, the biggest cost savings are gonna come from replacing some of the more repetitive manual roles with automated systems. how do i justify those types of cuts to my board, and is it actually worth worrying about the turnover if the new system is way more efficient?",
