    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the board is mostly interested in the bottom line though. they see the automation as a way to permanently lower the headcount and the payroll. if i can show them that we can basically achieve the same output with 30% fewer people, isn't that just the most logical business move? i don't see why i should prioritize \"human training\" if the tech is just meant to do the job instead.",
